1
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:08,840
Mr. Zhao.

2
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:09,760
Something you need?

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,440
Ms. Yu, you sure know
how to keep your cool.

4
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:16,320
If I couldn't keep my cool,

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,720
why would you come to me yourself?

6
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:22,160
(Persian Cat)
But I'm curious.

7
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:24,240
How did you find out my secret?

8
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,480
Because of

9
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:28,000
your scent.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,500
=Dear Song=

11
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:32,780
=Episode 4=
(Threats from Her Own Kind)

12
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:34,780
(Cairui Ads, Design & Print)

13
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:39,600
(Stamp Room, Display Racks, Printing)

14
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,120
Sir,

15
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,120
I need to print a resume.

16
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:42,800
0.5 yuan a page.

17
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:46,220
(Yunshang City Supermarket)

18
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:48,600
(File Folder)
I want

19
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,240
the five-thousand-a-page kind.

20
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:52,920
Everything I need is listed there.

21
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:57,940
(Yu Song: Objective, Family Background,
Professional Skills, Internship Skills)

22
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:04,400
Sir.

23
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:05,800
I'm here for my business card.

24
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:09,980
(Cairui Ads)

25
00:01:09,980 --> 00:01:13,460
(Stamp Room)

26
00:01:20,460 --> 00:01:23,340
(Zhao Hui, Executive General Manager)

27
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:25,360
You're the project director.

28
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:27,240
Song Huan's the general manager.

29
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:29,280
I've always handled

30
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:30,600
Song Group's overseas projects.

31
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,480
A lot of overseas bosses

32
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:34,120
don't bother with background checks.

33
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,760
I made a small change.

34
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:36,920
No one will notice.

35
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:41,520
Mr. Zhao, you didn't impersonate anyone.

36
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:44,840
You just slipped in
the word "executive."

37
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:47,720
Not flashy enough to draw attention.

38
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:50,160
Not obvious enough to raise suspicion.

39
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:52,240
That day,

40
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:54,520
I couldn't get a good look at your face
with that hat on,

41
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:59,000
but your scent

42
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,160
left a deep impression on me.

43
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:03,520
I didn't recognize you until
Song Huaishan's birthday,

44
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,360
when Song Lin pushed you down.

45
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:13,960
Mr. Zhao, you act like you want nothing,

46
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,640
but you're more calculating
than you let on.

47
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,840
(Persian Cat)

48
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:21,160
People from privileged backgrounds
tend to prefer subtle scents.

49
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:24,000
Ms. Yu, your disguise is perfect.

50
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:25,720
Except for your own scent.

51
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:29,160
If it's not an oversight,

52
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:31,800
then it's a habit you can't shake.

53
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:34,440
I'm curious.

54
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,320
What are you hiding?

55
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:37,960
That's none of your business.

56
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:38,960
Just say it.

57
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:40,040
What do you want?

58
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:42,760
I like how direct you are.

59
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,920
When Song Huan
gets back from her business trip,

60
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,760
she'll be focused
on the hot spring project.

61
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,400
I need you

62
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:51,000
to put this

63
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,520
in her room.

64
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,920
You...

65
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:12,160
You want me

66
00:03:12,160 --> 00:03:14,560
to bug her room for trade secrets?

67
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:20,120
You don't even deserve to be
in their family photo.

68
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,840
And you think you can be
the head of the Song family?

69
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:24,240
What do you know?

70
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:26,240
Song Huaishan favors boys over girls.

71
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:28,320
Being a man is my biggest advantage!

72
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:30,320
If Song Huaishan's son hadn't died,

73
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:31,520
that wretch Song Huan

74
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:33,120
wouldn't be calling the shots
at the company!

75
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,320
Song Huaishan had a son?

76
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:37,920
He died when he was ten.

77
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,120
I don't care about any of that.

78
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:42,400
As long as I can snatch
Song Huan's project,

79
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,520
Song Huaishan will probably

80
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:46,240
make me general manager.

81
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,360
And then

82
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,040
I won't need any fake business cards.

83
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,200
I know.

84
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:53,120
Your resume is fake,

85
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,800
but your skills are real.

86
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,520
I'm impressed with you.

87
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,520
Maybe

88
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,920
I can offer you

89
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:03,000
another opportunity down the line.

90
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:06,840
Mr. Zhao,

91
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:09,200
don't worry about my future.

92
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:12,320
But I'd appreciate it
if you didn't get in my way.

93
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:15,000
I'll take the card.

94
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,360
We need dirt on each other to be allies.

95
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,000
Holy crap.

96
00:04:24,020 --> 00:04:26,080
(Song Huaishan: Song family ties,
calculating, crafty, always prepared)

97
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:28,200
(Lecherous, twisted, vain,
obsessed with appearances, scheming)

98
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:30,520
I've been so focused on investigating
the Song family.

99
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:34,440
I forgot about this inconspicuous
son-in-law who married into the family.

100
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,120
Jing,

101
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:38,160
what do you know about him?

102
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:40,200
Zhao Hui got his master's
at A University,

103
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,960
then interned at Song Group.

104
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:44,920
Back then, Song Lin had the title
of brand director

105
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:46,120
but goofed off all day.

106
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:48,000
Zhao Hui handled every task

107
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,400
Song Huaishan gave her.

108
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:50,400
In the office.

109
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:51,400
Just the two of them.

110
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:52,320
Sparks flew.

111
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:56,200
They weren't from the same social class,

112
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:58,120
but Song Lin said
she'd marry no one else.

113
00:04:58,520 --> 00:05:00,160
So Song Huaishan had to agree.

114
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,320
A son-in-law who marries
into a wealthy family

115
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:04,320
gets no share of assets or stock.

116
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:06,200
Song Huaishan hired himself a worker.

117
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,360
Not a bad deal.

118
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:11,520
Later, Song Lin's position
went to Zhao Hui.

119
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:13,240
And to this day,

120
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,920
he's sitting pretty as project director.

121
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:16,280
By the way,

122
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:16,920
Jing,

123
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,120
you've been with the Songs for years.

124
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:21,320
Did you ever hear about a son
in the Song family?

125
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,240
Why ask that all of a sudden?

126
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:29,600
Zhao Hui said

127
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:31,320
Song Huaishan used to have a son.

128
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:34,520
A rich family losing a son is big news,

129
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:36,320
yet there's no record of it anywhere.

130
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,720
I think there's definitely
a secret there.

131
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:43,440
I was young back then.

132
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,560
All I knew was his name was Song Jing.

133
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:48,320
Not much else.

134
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,520
Let's look into Zhao Hui first.

135
00:05:58,360 --> 00:06:00,560
I don't like other people
having more dirt on me

136
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,760
than I have on them.

137
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:02,780
(Calculating, crafty,
always prepared, lecherous)

138
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:04,320
It's not fair.

139
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:08,040
So

140
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,760
you're gonna help Zhao Hui?

141
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,120
I'd be helping myself too.

142
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:15,800
(Song Huan is the hardest to read
in the family.)

143
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:18,040
(Getting close to her through Zhao Hui)

144
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:21,520
(is the best move right now.)

145
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:32,560
Ms. Song Cheng,

146
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,920
it's getting chilly.

147
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,400
Let me grab you a shawl.

148
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:35,960
Okay.

149
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,520
Song Huan's flight gets in tonight.

150
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,640
Better hurry.

151
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:02,680
Or

152
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,320
your real background file

153
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:05,920
shows up

154
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,440
in Mr. Song's office tomorrow.

155
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:12,120
Mr. Zhao, if you want me
to do something for you,

156
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:13,960
we do it my way.

157
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:16,040
Threats don't work on me.

158
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,080
Ms. Chen.

159
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,920
What is it?

160
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:35,720
Are you busy?

161
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,320
Ms. Song Huan's coming home today.

162
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:39,720
I need to get her room cleaned up.

163
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:44,760
Where's my brown tie?

164
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:46,520
I've got an important meeting tonight.

165
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,120
Coming.

166
00:08:20,960 --> 00:08:22,480
(We're safest when we're all)

167
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,640
(in the same boat.)

168
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:24,320
Everyone, come take a look!

169
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:27,600
This is our student council president's
excellent resume.

170
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:29,320
Straight A-plus grades.

171
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:31,560
Three-time scholarship winner.

172
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:33,560
Amazing, isn't it?

173
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:36,120
(This resume really does look good.)

174
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,200
(But it's useless.)

175
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,520
(Here, it's ability that counts.)

176
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:39,360
Give it back.

177
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,040
Yu Song.

178
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:46,440
This is the kind of resume
the Song family wants.

179
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:48,120
Connections.

180
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,240
You get it?

181
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:51,240
My dad does business with Song Group.

182
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:53,000
Why don't you beg me?

183
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:53,600
Maybe

184
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:55,280
I can get you a job

185
00:09:55,280 --> 00:09:56,560
as a cleaner.

186
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:01,720
Since when

187
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:03,960
does Song Group let outsiders
call the shots?

188
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,280
Ms. Song.

189
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:09,720
That's not what I meant.

190
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:11,040
Find out

191
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:13,720
which projects every one of them has

192
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,760
with Song Group.

193
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:16,320
Cancel them all.

194
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:18,480
Ms. Song,

195
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:18,960
I...

196
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,240
I'm not standing up for you.

197
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:24,040
I'm just taking out the trash
for the Song family.

198
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,840
I was gonna say,

199
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,840
you've always been my idol.

200
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:28,920
I dream

201
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:31,200
of becoming a successful woman like you.

202
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:36,720
Little girl,

203
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:39,520
there are only two kinds of people
in this world.

204
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:42,720
Those who make the rules,
and those who follow them.

205
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:45,120
If you want respect,

206
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:46,920
you have to be the former.

207
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,440
What if

208
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:53,480
the rules I want to change

209
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,760
are the Song family's?

210
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:03,920
Yu Song?

211
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:06,320
What are you doing here?
